    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world consumed by monstrous tides, time becomes your greatest enemy. As the last survivor, you must fight through endless hordes of creatures, seeking a way to break free. Every battle is a symphony of survival, and you must follow the rhythm of destruction, evolve continuously, and face your ultimate destiny!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freely Customize Your Build</strong>: Choose 6 active skills and 6 passive skills per run to create your ultimate combat strategy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience-Based Growth:</strong> Defeat monsters to gain experience. With each level-up, you can unlock new skills or enhance existing ones, growing stronger as the battle progresses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold &amp; Permanent Upgrades</strong>: Collect gold during gameplay and use it to upgrade passive skills outside the game, making you even stronger in future battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement Unlock System</strong>: Complete specific achievements to unlock new characters and skills, expanding your combat possibilities!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Skill Builds &amp; Stunning Effects: Each attack delivers a thrilling visual and impact experience, making every battle more immersive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scaling Monster Waves &amp; Increasing Challenge: Enemy numbers grow over time, ramping up from sparse encounters to overwhelming survival trials. The battle rhythm intensifies, keeping you engaged!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive Maps &amp; Tactical Terrain: Each map features unique visual styles and environmental obstacles that influence your combat strategy!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world consumed by monstrous tides, time becomes your greatest enemy. As the last survivor, you must fight through endless hordes of creatures, seeking a way to break free. Every battle is a symphony of survival, and you must follow the rhythm of destruction, evolve continuously, and face your ultimate destiny!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freely Customize Your Build</strong>: Choose 6 active skills and 6 passive skills per run to create your ultimate combat strategy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience-Based Growth:</strong> Defeat monsters to gain experience. With each level-up, you can unlock new skills or enhance existing ones, growing stronger as the battle progresses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold &amp; Permanent Upgrades</strong>: Collect gold during gameplay and use it to upgrade passive skills outside the game, making you even stronger in future battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement Unlock System</strong>: Complete specific achievements to unlock new characters and skills, expanding your combat possibilities!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Skill Builds &amp; Stunning Effects: Each attack delivers a thrilling visual and impact experience, making every battle more immersive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scaling Monster Waves &amp; Increasing Challenge: Enemy numbers grow over time, ramping up from sparse encounters to overwhelming survival trials. The battle rhythm intensifies, keeping you engaged!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive Maps &amp; Tactical Terrain: Each map features unique visual styles and environmental obstacles that influence your combat strategy!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In Survivor\u2019s Rhythm, rhythm is the key to survival! This fast-paced roguelike hack-and-slash throws you into endless monster waves. Dodge, attack, and grow stronger in an intense 30-minute battle. Defeat the final Boss and claim victory!",
